schway-screen 1
screen shell-outcomes
title Shell exit evidence
description Exit codes, cancellation, timeout, unknown evidence and tool errors retain distinct text and glyphs.
variant light-120
size 120x36
cursor 7 33 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

   ✓  BASH   exit 0                                                                                Exit 0 · 1.2s ▸
   !  BASH   exit 7                                                                                Exit 7 · 1.2s ▸
   −  BASH   kill -TERM $$                                                                        Stopped · 1.2s ▸
