     Command cancelled.

   !  BASH   sleep 5                                                                                   Timed out ▾
     Command timed out.
     Tool failed. Inspect this result before continuing.

   −  BASH   run saved command                                                           No exit observed · 1.2s ▸
   −  BASH   inspect invalid exit details                                                No exit observed · 1.2s ▸
   !  BASH   run unavailable command                                                                  Tool error ▾
     Command could not start.
     Tool failed. Inspect this result before continuing.














